id: SECRETS-004
title: DigitalOcean Personal Access Token
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
patterns:
  - regex: dop_v1_[a-f0-9]{64}
    message: DigitalOcean personal access token detected. This grants full API access to your DigitalOcean account.
fix: Revoke the token at DigitalOcean > API > Tokens. Generate a new scoped token and store it in environment variables or a secrets manager.
